  "description": "Same Jimmy spirit, just refined in all the right places.\n\nBuilt around our proven gravel geometry, JIMMY V2.1 keeps the balanced ride feel people already love, now updated with a refined steel fin dropout, durable MKPT Cromoly tubing, and the versatile No.11 carbon fork.\n\nIt’s made for gravel rides, bikepacking trips, and those random roads that turn into long adventures.\n\nThe M5 threaded thru axle design makes front and rear rack setup simple, while the optional frame rack gives you even more carrying options when the trip gets bigger.\n\nFinished with ED black coating for better long-term durability, JIMMY V2.1 stays true to what a good steel bike should be — simple, dependable, and always ready to go a little further.\n\nShimano Di2 routing compatible",
